\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Headroom decomposition} (18 quad cells, core-400, official judge). Oracle accuracy is essentially unchanged across arms; the unmatched headroom differences are carried by best-fixed accuracy, not by population utility. Yield: $K$/144 slots A/B/C/D = 104/110/101/69; per-builder $R_{\mathrm  {artifact}}$ 0.13 (GLM) to 0.80 (ERNIE).}}{9}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:decomp}{{4}{9}{\textbf {Headroom decomposition} (18 quad cells, core-400, official judge). Oracle accuracy is essentially unchanged across arms; the unmatched headroom differences are carried by best-fixed accuracy, not by population utility. Yield: $K$/144 slots A/B/C/D = 104/110/101/69; per-builder $R_{\mathrm {artifact}}$ 0.13 (GLM) to 0.80 (ERNIE)}{table.4}{}}
